            "Our work is mainly related with textual entailment and how it is applied to solve other NLP tasks.\n",
            "\\paragraph{Textual entailment.}  \\citet{pascal} first introduced the concept of \\standardentail~and released a challenging benchmark, \\emph{Recognizing Textual Entailment} (RTE), for it. Then it attracted many following studies and the early stage of \\standardentail~study  mainly focused on  lexical and syntactic level features \\cite{DBLPAndroutsopoulosM10,DBLPReiB11}.\n",
