            "The loss $l$ of \\parallelmodel~is  defined as the binary cross entropy (BCE) over all \\texttt{H}$_i$ ($i=1,\\cdots,k$):\n",
            "\\begin{equation}\n",
            "    l = -\\frac{1}{k}\\sum_{i=1}^k y_i \\cdot \\mathrm{log} s_i + (1-y_i)\\cdot \\mathrm{log}(1-s_i)\n",
            "\\end{equation}\n",
