            "As shown in Figure~\\ref{fig_k_impact}, we report top-$k$ recall, where $k$ varies from 10 to 100 for UFET  and 10 to 70 for (3-shot) BANKING77  due to the max  length limit of RoBERTa. We also show the \\parallelmodel~performance under different $k$ values. \n",
